    {
      "id": "ae8e7970-4ef3-446d-be76-5b39ff807504",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1000,
        -560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 720,
        "height": 800,
        "content": "## Confirm appointments by SMS from Google Calendar\n\n### How it works\n1. Every 15 minutes, reads the appointments of the next 24 hours in your Google Calendar.\n2. Sends each client one SMS reminder that asks for a reply: **YES** to confirm, **NO** to cancel. The client's first name and mobile number are read from the event description (`Name:` and `Phone:` lines).\n3. On the next runs, reads the client's reply with the `get_responses` tool of the SMS Vert Pro MCP server:\n   - **YES**: the event turns green and gets **[Confirmed by SMS]**.\n   - **NO**: the event turns red, gets **[Cancelled by SMS]**, and you receive an SMS alert so you can offer the slot to someone else.\n   - Any other reply is copied into the event, so you can read it.\n4. Reminders that never reached the client (unknown number, phone off for days) are flagged in the event, so you can call them.\nEvery step is written in the event itself: no spreadsheet or database needed. Nothing is sent outside the sending hours (08:00 to 21:00 by default).\n\n### Setup steps\n1. Connect your Google account in the Google Calendar nodes.\n2. Create a **Bearer Auth** credential with your SMS Vert Pro API V2 token (log in at smsvertpro.com, then open https://www.smsvertpro.com/api/doc-v2.php) and select it in the four MCP Client nodes.\n3. In **Settings**, set your calendar ID (`primary` or the calendar's email address), your business name and your message. Placeholders: `{name}`, `{date}`, `{time}`, `{business}`.\n4. Set **owner_phone** to your own mobile number in international format (for example 33XXXXXXXXX) to be alerted of cancellations. Leave it empty to turn the alert off.\n5. In your events, add two lines to the description: `Name: Julie` and `Phone: +33 6 XX XX XX XX`.\n\n### Good to know\n- Keep **36173** as the sender: it is the SMS Vert Pro reply number. A sender name (like MySalon) cannot receive replies.\n- Replies are matched with each reminder, so give each client one appointment reminder at a time.\n\n### Customization\nChange the reply words (**yes_words**, **no_words**), the colors (Google Calendar color IDs 1 to 11), **hours_ahead** to remind 48 hours before, or **locale** to `fr` for French dates."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "9658eb7c-3a8c-4817-970a-4fdec99ff3f3",
